From b7734899bc398ed350e573a1ce51b6195fb533e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Faber <72028327+Jonohas@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:41:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/17] SystemUI: release the fold animation latch on sleep and
 timeout

Release the latched style when the device sleeps or 10 s after a latch, and
let a gated provider whose token was released start a fresh transition. Latch
at the screen-on handshake so the overlays and the gate agree on the style.
